  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia - BEPS Assessment Tool (BAT) Project 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">From February to December 2025, IBFD implemented the Ethiopia BEPS Assessment Tool (BAT) project in cooperation with the Ministry of Finance (MOF) and Ministry of Revenue (MOR) of Ethiopia. The B.A.T. was delivered in several phases: (i) Inception/Kick Off; (ii) BAT questionnaire roll out, data gathering,  desk work; (iii) Analysis of data provided and desk work; (iv) In-country visit /  five-day validation mission to Addis Ababa by three IBFD senior tax experts (13&#x2013;17 October); (v) Drafting report; and (vi) Presentation and discussion of findings, recommendations and priorities for future interventions with key MOF and MOR stakeholders from 11 to 12 December 2025 in Addis Ababa.</narrative>
  </description>
